course: dictionary
lesson: 10763
title: Words that help
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Useful means that something helps you do a job or reach a goal. A torch is useful in a power cut, because it gives you light when you need it. When you meet useful in a text, ask: useful for what? The answer is usually in the words around it.
explain: «A doctor cannot feel your pain, so the most useful thing you can do is say clearly where it hurts.» Here useful means helpful for the doctor. Saying where it hurts gives the doctor the information they need. The clue is the job the sentence describes: helping someone to help you.
explain: Useful can also describe a person or a job. «Helping with the washing up or loading the dishwasher is useful work at home» shows that a job is useful when it makes life easier. To check your meaning, swap in helpful: if the sentence still makes sense, you have found it.
fact: Useful means helps you do something or is good for a purpose.
fact: A useful person helps a lot.
fact: Useful is an adjective, so it describes a noun, as in a useful tool or a useful tip.
fact: The opposite of useful is useless, which means it does not help at all.
fact: «A wrong prediction is still useful, because it teaches you something.» Here useful means it helps you learn.
exercise: «A wrong prediction is still useful, because it teaches you something.» What does useful mean here? | Pretty to look at | *Helps you learn something | Expensive | Very loud
exercise: A torch is useful in a power cut. What is it useful for? | Cooking dinner | *Giving light when it is dark | Keeping cool in summer | Playing music
exercise: Which word means the opposite of useful? | *Useless | Helpful | Important | Handy
test: «Your gut holds trillions of useful bacteria.» In this sentence, useful bacteria are | Sleeping | Harmful to your body | *Helpful to your body | Invisible to doctors
test: Which sentence shows a useful person? | The boy sat quietly in the corner | *Mia loaded the dishwasher so Dad could rest | The dog barked at the postman | It rained all day
exam: In «Small does not mean worse at everything; a small model can be useful in a careful way», useful means | Very large | Breakable | *Helpful, when used with care | Only for toys
